msgid "plugins.generic.ojsbrJatsViewer.displayName"
msgstr "Multilingual JATS Viewer"

msgid "plugins.generic.ojsbrJatsViewer.description"
msgstr "Shows the JATS XML galleys as text in the journal page, built on the server, with a selector for the language of the text when the XML has translations (SciELO sub-article), and panels of figures and of tables. It replaces the Lens Galley viewer while enabled; the download of the galley still returns the XML file."

